@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@
+# MaaEnd / MXU Windows HWND repair
+
+## Status
+
+Prepared from official MXU v2.6.1. Build validation is recorded in BUILD-VALIDATION.json after compilation.
+
+## Fix
+
+Windows HWND values are normalized to their significant low 32 bits before caching and JSON serialization. This prevents JavaScript Number precision loss. Other platforms are unchanged.
+
+This build preserves MXU v2.6.1 changes, including schedule timing and repeated-start crash fixes. It is intended for MaaEnd v2.30.1 with MaaFramework v5.14.0.
+
+Automatic update downloads and automatic installation are disabled only for versions carrying the hwndfix prerelease label. Manual update controls remain available. Installing an official package may overwrite the HWND repair; verify upstream source before updating.
+
+## Install and rollback
+
+Close MaaEnd. Back up the existing MaaEnd.exe and config directory. Replace only MaaEnd.exe; retain the installed framework, agents, interface and resources. Start normally and verify connection and screenshot before running tasks. To roll back, close MaaEnd and restore the backed-up executable.
+
+## Rebuild
+
+On Windows x86_64 with Rust stable MSVC, Windows SDK, Node.js 22.12+ and pnpm 10.28.0, run Build-Windows-HwndFix.ps1. The archive includes corresponding source and upstream LICENSE.
